{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33960","headline":"孙发百篇将游天台请诗赠行因以送之 · 皮日休","name":"孙发百篇将游天台请诗赠行因以送之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孙子荆家思有余，元戎曾荐入公车。\n百篇宫体喧金屋，一日官衔下玉除。\n紫府近通斋後梦，赤城新有寄来书。\n因逢二老如相问，正滞江南爲𩸃鱼","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}